// bodmas + modulo (modulo is division, returning remainder, so treat it as division)
// 10 * (4 + 2) + pow(2, 2) % 5
// 10 * (4 + 2) + 4 % 5
// 10 * 6 + 4 % 5
// 60 + 4 % 5
// 60 + 4 (4 % 5 is 0 with remainder 4)
// 64
int bodmas = 10 * (4 + 2) + pow(2, 2) % 5;

